'''Eyes''' are immobile and attack by rotating towards Isaac and firing a {{i|Technology}} laser towards his position. Non-Eye enemies hit by the lasers take 8 damage.

The battle against {{E|Mom's Heart}} / {{E|It Lives!}} begins with an Eye on either side of it.
{{clear}}

